{"1429080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Business Heroes: Street Grub", "steam_appid": 1429080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Founder Test, Served Hot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Street Grub</strong> is a tycoon, management, and strategy game built around one uncomfortable question:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you actually have the instincts to run a business?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You sell burgers. That part is simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything else is the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1429080/extras/ea66bd3ac05c846916d00ec229f686ab.poster.avif?t=1779163601\" width=766 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1429080/extras/ea66bd3ac05c846916d00ec229f686ab.webm?t=1779163601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1429080/extras/ea66bd3ac05c846916d00ec229f686ab.mp4?t=1779163601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every Decision Hits The Ledger</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Set your price</strong> and find out if customers think you are bold or delusional.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tune your recipe</strong> to balance cost, quality, demand, and reviews.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage stock</strong> before waste, shortages, or bad planning eats your profit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hire and train staff</strong> without letting payroll quietly strangle the business.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run marketing</strong> when you need attention, traffic, and momentum.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade and expand</strong> when growth is real, not when your ego says it is.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plan At Night. Face The Market By Day.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At night, you read the numbers and make the call.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, the street answers back. Customers queue up or walk away. Reviews spread. Rivals react. Weather and events shift demand. The economy moves. Cash gets tight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The market keeps asking the same question:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you building a business, or just spending money loudly?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Not A Lesson. A Pressure Test.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a course dressed up as a game. It is a hands-on business pressure test inside a burger tycoon.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise prices too far and demand can turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut quality too hard and reviews can punish you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire too fast and payroll can bury you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand too early and cash flow can snap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ignore rivals and the market can move without you.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow Or Go Broke</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small. Watch the numbers. Read the market. Make sharper calls than your competitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Street Grub</strong> is for players who enjoy management games where success is earned through judgment, timing, and the ability to stay calm when the business gets ugly.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Founder Test, Served Hot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Street Grub</strong> is a tycoon, management, and strategy game built around one uncomfortable question:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you actually have the instincts to run a business?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You sell burgers. That part is simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything else is the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1429080/extras/ea66bd3ac05c846916d00ec229f686ab.poster.avif?t=1779163601\" width=766 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1429080/extras/ea66bd3ac05c846916d00ec229f686ab.webm?t=1779163601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1429080/extras/ea66bd3ac05c846916d00ec229f686ab.mp4?t=1779163601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every Decision Hits The Ledger</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Set your price</strong> and find out if customers think you are bold or delusional.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tune your recipe</strong> to balance cost, quality, demand, and reviews.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage stock</strong> before waste, shortages, or bad planning eats your profit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hire and train staff</strong> without letting payroll quietly strangle the business.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run marketing</strong> when you need attention, traffic, and momentum.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade and expand</strong> when growth is real, not when your ego says it is.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plan At Night. Face The Market By Day.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At night, you read the numbers and make the call.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, the street answers back. Customers queue up or walk away. Reviews spread. Rivals react. Weather and events shift demand. The economy moves. Cash gets tight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The market keeps asking the same question:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you building a business, or just spending money loudly?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Not A Lesson. A Pressure Test.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a course dressed up as a game. It is a hands-on business pressure test inside a burger tycoon.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise prices too far and demand can turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut quality too hard and reviews can punish you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire too fast and payroll can bury you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand too early and cash flow can snap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ignore rivals and the market can move without you.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow Or Go Broke</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small. Watch the numbers. Read the market. Make sharper calls than your competitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Street Grub</strong> is for players who enjoy management games where success is earned through judgment, timing, and the ability to stay calm when the business gets ugly.</p>", "short_description": "A food truck tycoon and street-food strategy game. Think you have founder instincts? Prove it with a burger bike, limited cash, and a market that punishes bad decisions. Set prices, tune recipes, manage stock, hire staff, outplay rivals, and see if your burger business grows or goes broke.", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese, English<strong>*</strong>, Arabic, French, German, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1429080/629a1f1a82ee619915ccf2755d269384da4f20ad/header.jpg?t=1779163601", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1429080/80670c846d5a9aef963d135cabf20ff6618a371c/ca